cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Un método lagrangiano para la identificación de situaciones de bloqueo atmosférico"
abstract: >-
  Bachelor's thesis proposing a Lagrangian method for identifying atmospheric
  blocking situations through the massive analysis of HYSPLIT back-trajectories
  driven by ERA5 reanalysis data, as an alternative to classical Eulerian,
  thermodynamic-field diagnostics. Candidate blocking regions are flagged where
  trajectories stagnate and delineated with DBSCAN density clustering.
type: thesis
authors:
  - family-names: "Ruiz Muñoz"
    given-names: "Juan Manuel"
    affiliation: "Universidad de Alicante, Facultad de Ciencias"
keywords:
  - atmospheric blocking
  - Lagrangian method
  - back-trajectories
  - HYSPLIT
  - ERA5
  - DBSCAN
  - climate change
